{"Permission check for team roles requires user to be both team admin AND team owner (using &&), which likely blocks legitimate admins/owners - should probably be admin OR owner": 0.9769765734672546, "Attendee email selection relies on passed newGuests list, but handler passes raw input list which may include existing attendees and filtered/blacklisted emails, causing existing attendees to receive wrong emails and mismatch between who gets 'add guests' vs 'scheduled' emails": 0.9798349738121033, "OrganizerAddGuestsEmail sets replyTo to include the organizer email plus every attendee email, which can leak attendee emails more broadly than intended depending on mail client behavior and forwarding": 0.7004551887512207, "Email sending errors are swallowed with generic console log, making it hard to debug production issues and hiding partial failures - should use structured logging with error object and decide on retry/surfacing strategy": 0.928666889667511, "No relevant tests for the changes": 0.8004190921783447}